The word is "226".
The size is the number of characters in word.
The ways is a list of size plus 1 zeros.
Set item 0 of ways to 1.
For every position from 1 to size.
The previous is one less than position.
The firstdigit is the digit value of character previous of word.
If firstdigit is more than 0, set item position of ways to item previous of ways.
The seconddigit is 0.
If position is more than 1, set seconddigit to the digit value of character (position minus 2) of word.
The pair is seconddigit times 10 plus firstdigit.
If position is more than 1 and pair is at least 10 and pair is at most 26, set item position of ways to item position of ways plus item (position minus 2) of ways.

Display item size of ways.
